#: ../../resources_page.rst:302
msgid "Direct Eraser Plugin"
msgstr "Direct Eraser - 直接橡皮擦"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:304
msgid ""
"Lets you create a shortcut for the eraser and brush that doesn't depend on "
"state. In other words, pressing the eraser shortcut always sets you up with "
"the brush in eraser mode, no toggling, no selecting the brush first."
msgstr ""
"提供一个额外的快捷键，专门用来分配给不想受笔刷状态影响的预设，如橡皮擦等。点"
"击该快捷键将直接将当前笔刷改为该预设并置于擦除模式下。"

