#: ../../resources_page.rst:341
msgid "Python auto-complete for text editors"
msgstr "Python auto-complete - Python 文本编辑器代码自动补全"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:343
msgid ""
"If you have the Krita source code, you can use this to generate the auto-"
"complete file for Python. Many Python editors need a :file:`.PY` file to "
"read for auto-complete information. This script reads the C++ header files "
"and creates a Python file that can be used for auto-completion."
msgstr ""
"大多数 Python 脚本编辑工具需要加载一个 :file:`.PY` 文件以读取自动完成信息，此"
"插件会自动读取 Krita 源代码的 C++ header 文件并生成该文件。要使用本插件，必须"
"下载 Krita 的源代码。"

