"and all your images will be exported into it as well as :file:`spine.json`."
msgstr ""
"此插件仿照功能相同的 Photoshop 官方插件编写，两者的工作方式也基本一致。点击菜"
"单栏的 :menuselection:`工具 --> 脚本 --> Export to Spline (导出到 Spline 文"
